        Tests/StornautInvestigationTests/InvestigationLifecycleTopologyCollectorTests.swift Tests/StornautInvestigationTests/InvestigationLifecycleTopologyTestSupport.swift Tests/StornautInvestigationTests/InvestigationMachineDriverHostTests.swift Tests/StornautInvestigationTests/InvestigationMachineScenarioTestSupport.swift Tests/StornautInvestigationTests/InvestigationMachineTargetBoundaryTests.swift
